    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seamless open-world fantasy role-playing sandbox simulation. Take control of one or multiple characters and roleplay as an adventurer, craftsman, trader, farmer, thief, and many other possibilities. Start with a single beggar, work up to a skilled team, buy properties, and build homes and businesses.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seamless open-world fantasy role-playing sandbox simulation. Take control of one or multiple characters and roleplay as an adventurer, craftsman, trader, farmer, thief, and many other possibilities. Start with a single beggar, work up to a skilled team, buy properties, and build homes and businesses.</p>",
    "short_description": "DreadMist is an open-world role-playing sandbox simulation. With the incredible mechanical depth of this fantasy sandbox, you can begin as a lowly beggar and advance to become skilled in crafting, trading, farming, thievery, combat, and many other activities. Gather others to create an adventure.",
